**For the Sovereign branding look** — set the user avatar too:
```bash
# Copy a profile picture for the sovereign user
sudo cp /mnt/usb/avatar.jpg /var/lib/AccountsService/icons/sovereign

# Tell AccountsService to use it
sudo nano /var/lib/AccountsService/users/sovereign
```
Add:
```ini
[User]
Icon=/var/lib/AccountsService/icons/sovereign
```

